   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "\u2022 Admin may refuse or delay; answer still pending\n\u2022 Admin-side setting changes are not monitored in v1\n\u2022 Wide reach could expose shared cluster to abuse or bulk use\n\u2022 Runner token theft would allow picking up users' jobs and ID\n   tokens",
